**/*_RESULTS.md
**/*_RESULTS_*.md
**/ABORTED.md

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Decoder variants outside the MBF-UF implementation
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# No BP decoder is currently present under these names. These rules prevent
# future BP/BP-OSD experiments from being included accidentally.
**/BP/
**/bp/
**/bp_decoder/
**/bp-decoder/
**/bp_osd/
**/bp-osd/
**/bposd/
**/belief_propagation/
**/belief-propagation/
**/*_bp_decoder.*
**/*-bp-decoder.*

